{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5688-awice-openapi-v1",
    "name": "5688 物流巴巴开放平台 OpenAPI v1",
    "description": "5688 物流巴巴开放平台官方 Postman 集合。\n\n## 使用方法\n\n1. 打开「Variables」（集合右侧 ⋯ → Edit），把 `app_key` 和 `app_secret` 改成你的应用凭证（控制台「应用管理」获取）\n2. 任意接口点 Send，Pre-request Script 会自动算好签名挂到 header 上\n3. 生产环境请把 `base_url` 改成 `https://www.5688.cn/api/openapi/v1`\n\n## 签名细节\n\n- 算法：HMAC-SHA256\n- 消息：`METHOD\\nPATH\\nTimestamp\\nNonce\\nMD5(BODY)`\n- PATH 取 `/openapi/v1/<endpoint>`（去掉 base_url 的 `/api` 部分）\n\n详见 https://www.5688.cn/open/docs/auth",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "awice-team"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 全局预请求脚本：自动算签名挂到 header",
          "// 与服务端 OpenApiSign 保持完全一致：",
          "//   HMAC-SHA256(secret, METHOD + \\n + PATH + \\n + Timestamp + \\n + Nonce + \\n + MD5(BODY))",
          "",
          "const appKey = pm.collectionVariables.get('app_key');",
          "const appSecret = pm.collectionVariables.get('app_secret');",
          "",
          "if (!appKey || !appSecret || appKey === 'AK_REPLACE_ME' || appSecret === 'REPLACE_ME') {",
          "    console.warn('[Awice] 请先在集合 Variables 里设置 app_key / app_secret');",
          "}",
          "",
          "const ts = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();",
          "// 16 字符随机 nonce",
          "const nonceBytes = new Array(8).fill(0).map(() => Math.floor(Math.random() * 256));",
          "const nonce = nonceBytes.map(b => b.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join('');",
          "",
          "// 拿 PATH —— 必须是 /openapi/v1/xxx 形式",
          "const url = pm.request.url;",
          "const pathArr = url.path || [];",
          "let pathname = '/' + pathArr.join('/');",
          "// base_url 里没有 /openapi/v1 时，path 就是 /openapi/v1/xxx，直接用",
          "// base_url 里已经有 /openapi/v1 时，path 就只是 /xxx，需要补",
          "const signPath = pathname.indexOf('/openapi/v1') === 0 ? pathname : '/openapi/v1' + pathname;",
          "",
          "const method = pm.request.method.toUpperCase();",
          "let body = '';",
          "if (method === 'POST' && pm.request.body && pm.request.body.raw) {",
          "    body = pm.variables.replaceIn(pm.request.body.raw);",
          "}",
          "const bodyMd5 = CryptoJS.MD5(body).toString();",
          "const message = method + '\\n' + signPath + '\\n' + ts + '\\n' + nonce + '\\n' + bodyMd5;",
          "const sign = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(message, appSecret).toString();",
          "",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Awice-AppKey', value: appKey });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Awice-Timestamp', value: ts });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Awice-Nonce', value: nonce });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Awice-Signature', value: sign });",
          "",
          "console.log('[Awice] sign_path=' + signPath + ' nonce=' + nonce + ' ts=' + ts);"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 全局响应断言：业务 code 必须为 0",
          "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
          "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
          "});",
          "pm.test('Body has code=0', function () {",
          "    const json = pm.response.json();",
          "    pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(0);",
          "});",
          "// 把 request_id 打到 console 便于排查",
          "try {",
          "    const json = pm.response.json();",
          "    if (json.request_id) console.log('[Awice] request_id=' + json.request_id);",
          "    if (json.code !== 0) console.error('[Awice] biz_error code=' + json.code + ' msg=' + json.msg);",
          "} catch (e) {}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
